Description: To-do list with built-in productivity timer, SQLite storage, and Jira/YouTrack sync
 Go for It Qt is a modern C++20 / Qt 6 productivity application combining task
 management with a built-in Pomodoro timer, single-file SQLite storage, and
 native Jira / JetBrains YouTrack integration.
